<title>UK: Household Finance sets 1.25 bln French franc FRN.</title>
<headline>Household Finance sets 1.25 bln French franc FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSEHOLD BANK NEVADA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  HOUSEHOLD FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT   1.25 BLN FRF   BASE	 3M-PIBOR  MATURITY    19.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE    19.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  ISS PRICE  100.065   FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   REOFFER    100.065</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS/LUX DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS US/GB/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
